WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:44.120
It's finished!

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.710
The old man's still got it!

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:47.790
What?!

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:50.790
She's still the same.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:55.340
I acted like an idiot.

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:58.050
What's dad doing?

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:06.140
Hurry, withdraw!

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:12.360
Mecha Hayama is
Hayama's Mama

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:15.110
What's this?

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:16.240
A present!

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:19.820
I made this myself.
It's for Akito.

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:22.410
It's really big!
You made it yourself?

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:23.660
Let's see what it is.

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:25.500
The sofa is in the way.

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:28.370
Dad, that's really rude. What if good kids saw what you just did?

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:32.250
Natsumi, your dad,
a long time ago, was...

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.590
Oh... this present...

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:37.630
What did you just want to say?
How come you only said half of it?

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:40.430
Oh yeah, maybe dad made some
household supplies?

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:43.550
Natsumi, what dad made is not a
household supply.

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:49.350
But every Sunday, you hide that storage room where if 100 people went in it could collapsed.

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:53.520
Natsumi, dad was a Mad Scientist.

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:57.150
That's English, so please let
American Babbit explain.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:59.450
A mad scientist is...

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:04.660
- I'm thinking right now... scientist...
- Explain, hurry!

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.700
What's up, Lucy?
Why are you so passionate?

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:09.540
So what did you make?

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:15.960
Help! Help!

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:18.420
Family reunion.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:24.010
Family reunion.

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:25.760
What the hell did you make, dad?

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:27.600
Mecha Mama...
this is your Mecha Mama.

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:32.100
Akito, go ahead and be bratty to
your mother...

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:34.940
Why are you tumbling on the sofa?

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:37.320
If you're like that,
you can't hug her, Akito.

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:39.780
See, mother is coming to you now.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:53.540
Akito.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.380
Akito, I'm your mother.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:00.420
Why is Hayama's face red?

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:02.590
What did you do?

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:05.390
What's the matter? You told me to
come out so early...

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:08.010
Degoko-chan, I like you.

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:11.310
Mama doesn't like violence.

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:16.060
I'm back. Today was such a bad day.

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.900
Mama is violent.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.530
What are you doing?

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:21.320
Hey, where the hell are you going?

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:22.450
Ran away.

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:24.360
What is all this, dad?

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:27.530
Actually, it still needs a thing
called 'motherly oven'.

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:29.990
But I thought it didn't matter,
so I didn't install it.

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:34.460
Like when you want to eat ramen with pepper, and don't have pepper, it doesn't matter, right?

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:36.540
Those are two totally different things!

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:38.380
Where the hell can you find
'motherly oven'?

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:43.380
The Asatsu stores in Shibuya have them. But it's really expensive, about 7,000.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:45.470
Only that much,
you should have bought it!

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:48.970
- Degoko-chan, why not me?
- I'm sorry.

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.220
What's happening?

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:54.690
Giant robot!

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:58.520
The hardware for giant robots was
on sale, 50% off.

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:01.780
How come there is a mother robot
and an additional giant robot?

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:04.110
This factory offered giant robots free when you buy small ones.

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:05.950
You want to try it, Natsumi?

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:07.450
How could I be in the mood for
that?

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:10.990
Oh my god, a giant robot has
suddenly appeared on the street.

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:12.620
It's chaos in town.

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:16.170
This is not good. You should have
installed 'motherly oven'.

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:19.170
Let me see... Asatsu store...

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:23.090
It's approaching Asatsu...
now it's all destroyed!

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:26.300
Ah, can't buy 'motherly oven' now.

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:30.430
Never thought this would happen.
Never.

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:33.720
It's near downtown Tokyo.
Call for 'pretty magical girl'!

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:34.600
Pretty magical girl.

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:37.060
Yes, this is 'pretty magical girl' center.

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:39.440
Sana-chan, now is for real.

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:42.690
- That Tokyo tower...
- Did you hear me?

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:45.650
- Ok, Sana is coming now...
- Sana-chan, we have to begin shooting now.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:48.570
You're from Tokyo, can you just
ignore the danger Tokyo is facing now?

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:50.370
But I'm from Osaka!

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:54.000
I have to go...
You're not listening to me.

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:55.120
Babbit!

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:59.960
This is who we have to represent justice for us? An actress junior high school first year student?

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:01.750
Can I go now?

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.380
My name is Kurata Sana,

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:05.880
justice ambassador, a junior high
school first-year student.

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:09.430
The giant robot is made by
mad scientist Hayama.

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:12.100
It's name is Mecha Hayama Mama.

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:16.350
The robot is destroying cars and houses.

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:18.020
Now it's moving toward the Tokyo tower.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:21.360
Oh shit, if Tokyo tower is
destroyed, we can't go there to visit.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:25.280
Although it's not very fun there,
if it got destroyed there's no second one.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:28.240
And in the aquarium there, they
have goldfish that know how to smile.

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:30.450
The goldfish that know how to
smile look like this.

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:33.490
- Ahh! It's coming!
- It's scary!

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:38.120
The destiny of Tokyo tower is like
a candle in the wind.

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:41.250
Symbol of Tokyo, representing
12 million residents' hearts.

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:44.710
It's in everybody's memory.
I can't let you destroy it.

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:47.210
Angel attack...

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:53.600
Oh! Angel finally appeared.

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:56.350
- That's great, Sana-chan.
- She finally came.

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:57.930
Go! Go!

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:03.230
Angel wand!

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.650
Magical spin.

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:15.160
The robot is pretty strong.

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:18.910
Of course, I installed the best
fighting software.

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:20.580
What the hell?

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:26.000
It's no good. I can't protect the Tokyo tower this way.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.010
What should I do?

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:31.800
Attack the other person's weakness.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:35.680
No matter how hard you think, you
won't come up with any good ideas.

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:37.060
Listen, robot.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:39.180
If you keep acting like this,
Hayama's dad is going to die.

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:40.640
Sana, that's cheap!

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.850
A justice ambassador shouldn't do that.

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:44.270
Sleazy!

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:48.730
This is all dad's fault, keeping
him hostage is acceptable.

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:52.660
Sana-chan, you should come to my
house to play again.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:56.330
Old man, what did you do?

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.330
Why would the robot know
how to attack?

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:05.290
Oh, Sana got shot.

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:07.170
Have it broken?

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:08.300
The angel is useless.

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:12.510
Ahhh, I'm losing her, I guess
the hostage strategy is not working.

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.010
Then, Sana-chan, good-bye.

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:16.890
- Looks like Sana didn't get her.
- And she hasn't wound.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.100
Changing face strategy.

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:19.430
She hasn't changed a bit yet.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:22.810
Long forgotten Sana double doll is
all worn out.

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:25.940
She attacked me, I have to attack
her back. Open my bag.

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:28.690
All the cockroaches,
come out and dance!

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.530
How can you defeat her with that?

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:36.410
Well, that didn't work. Then
let's ask Naozumi-kun to help!

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.120
That's useless too.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:40.910
It's working.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:43.370
See, it's working.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:46.880
Looking at Naozumi-kun's idiotic
face is pretty painful, isn't it?

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:48.920
I'm an idiot, and stupid,
I'm sorry.

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:51.010
Oh, sorry about that.

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:55.300
Sana-chan, you know if I played seriously, you wouldn't have anything to say.

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.140
Ahhh, you're playing really well.

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:58.510
It didn't change anything.

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:12.780
Next,
it's Rei-kun singing fall down!

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:15.070
Don't think you can harass a girl like me!

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:16.490
Wait.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:20.660
- Akito-kun!
- Akito, it's dangerous!

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.080
Come on, let's go.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:26.290
Please, let her go.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:28.000
Hayama...

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:31.380
Although she's big,
and not a good thing...

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:32.670
She's still...

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.430
She still my mother.

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:38.760
Please.

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:46.350
Oh, I can see her panties, but I
better not say anything.

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:54.360
Are those tears?

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.740
I'm afraid that's love.

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:58.320
Scientist?

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:01.830
I would've never thought that a
robot would have emotions.

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:05.660
Scientist, maybe Hayama-kun's love
moved her.

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:09.960
They are warmhearted,
but it's only oil.

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:15.340
Mom.

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:24.680
Everybody lay down.

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:48.120
Tokyo residents' symbol,
the tower,

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:51.380
Tokyo's tower's peace has been
beautifully protected,

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:54.040
all because of the 'magical angel'.

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.970
Everything's been destroyed.

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:02.140
Let's go see those smiling goldfish.

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.390
Where's Akito-kun?

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:06.100
Don't disturb them.

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:07.390
Yes.

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:09.640
Akito.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.940
The robot probably blew us away...

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:20.450
because she knew she would blow up
and therefore wanted to save her own children.

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:21.740
Really?

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:22.990
Really.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:25.870
Must be.

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:27.200
Akito...

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.660
What, Natsumi?

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:30.410
Call me sister.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.920
Ah, Natsumi, Akito.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:38.050
Where did you go?

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:40.260
Dad was lonely by himself.

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:43.300
Because dad was so lonely,
dad made another robot.

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:47.390
This one is capable of
tracking you down.

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:49.600
To be continued

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:52.060
It's over,
I don't want it to continue.

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:59.690
I'm lonely!

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:06.280
I'm cleaning.

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:11.580
It's New Year's Eve busy cleaning
and getting ready for the New Year.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.420
Good morning, Sana.

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:18.800
Mama,
why did you turn into a clock?

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:23.010
Maro-chan became a cuckoo
in the clock?

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:25.050
And you turned into a skunk.

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:27.640
Good morning, Sana-chan.

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:29.850
Rei-kun, where are you?
Where are you?

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:32.310
Here, here, I turned into a carpet.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:36.060
Sana-chan, I turned into
a refrigerator.

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:37.520
Shimura-san!

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:40.440
For breakfast, you can take it out
from here yourself.

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:43.700
What a strange world!

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:48.660
Spell on the Toilet Seat

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:51.700
I can't go to school nor work like this!

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:53.750
You can do animal programs though.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:57.040
But why is this happening?

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:59.170
Maybe we ate something bad?

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:01.710
The fried noodle I ate yesterday?

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:03.920
I had fried onion yesterday.

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:06.680
I had the leftover curry from
the day before.

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:07.970
I had sushi.

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:10.010
Ahhh, you had it all by yourself?

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:11.640
I was discussing book publishing!

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:13.850
We all ate different things,

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:15.730
so there must be another reason.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:17.980
Maybe it's payback time.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:19.940
You didn't do a good job as
a manager.

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:24.610
Well, Sensei always misses deadlines,
so this is payback time for her too.

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:28.160
Since we started talking,
the picture hasn't changed a bit.

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:29.530
This is boring.

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:31.830
Oh, somebody's here.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.580
Hi, Kurata here.

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.790
Sana-chan,
I turned into a gold fish.

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:38.830
I'm an elephant.
Oh, Sana-chan is a skunk.

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:41.000
Ha, we're the same kind.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:43.130
We're better than a skunk.

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:45.010
Yeah, a skunk is smelly.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.130
Hey.

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:48.050
Skunk? It stinks.

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:50.100
What about you, Hayama?

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:51.890
You stink too.

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.350
Don't come over here.

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:54.730
I hate the pig!

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:55.100
Idiot!

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:58.770
The problem is
what does a skunk eat?

00:13:58.770 --> 00:13:59.650
What about an elephant?

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:02.190
They have food for goldfish in
a shopping mall.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:03.860
A pig eats tree roots.

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:05.610
We have to find out before noon.

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:07.700
Idiots!

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:10.530
You're still worrying about
lunch?

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:12.830
You all want to look like this
for New Year?

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:15.950
But why is this happening?
We're clueless.

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:17.920
A goat eats paper?

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:21.040
I heard something from my grandpa.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.540
What?

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:24.880
Grandpa turned into a salmon.

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:27.590
This must be the prince's spell, Fuka.

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:29.890
What's the prince's spell?

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:32.390
And what would your grandpa
know about that?

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:34.100
I'm not sure.

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:36.980
But if we go find that prince,
we will figure it out.

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:38.850
Ok, let's go, skunk.

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:40.560
Don't call me skunk, you pig!

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:42.400
Don't think you can harass a pig.

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:44.940
Where does the prince live,
Fuka-chan?

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:46.280
In Oji (prince).

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:49.490
- Isn't Oji on the north side of Tokyo?
- Yeah.

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:52.120
It's pretty easy to take
the train to get there.

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:54.620
Ah, it's here.

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:56.200
This place is huge.

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:58.080
How much is the rent?

00:14:58.080 --> 00:14:59.670
Anybody here?

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:01.750
It looks like somebody is there.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:05.000
Welcome, everybody. I've been
waiting for you all a long time.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:10.430
I'm the owner of this castle,
I'm Prince Naozumi.

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:12.300
Toilet seat.

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:13.760
Toilet seat prince.

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:17.220
Hey, I'm prince.

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:18.730
But now a toilet seat.

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:21.230
- You shut up, pig.
- I'm a pig, so what?

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:26.440
Toilet seat, no, Prince Naozumi,
why do you look like this...?

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:27.530
It's because...

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:32.160
when I was still human,
I was very handsome.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:35.780
But... there was an old lady who
knew magic.

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:37.580
This one.

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:40.500
She put a spell on me and
I turned into this.

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:42.670
- It's no like that old lady.
- Old lady!

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:45.500
The King told me to do this
when he was still alive.

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:48.130
It's because you never cleaned up
your own mess,

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:50.010
throwing trash everywhere...

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:52.720
...didn't like taking baths...

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:56.470
...didn't change your clothes even if they were dirty, didn't like being clean.

00:15:56.470 --> 00:16:00.640
King said if you still didn't
change when you began junior high school,

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:04.560
then I would have to punish you.
I just followed what he said.

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.270
- It stinks.
- It's hopeless.

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:09.690
It looks like the wrinkly old lady is right.

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:12.490
Who is the wrinkly old lady?

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:15.240
Undo the spell please,
wrinkly old lady.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:20.000
You haven't repented at all,
I will never help you.

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:23.580
I was just going to call you
old lady, but the pig confused me...

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.130
What shall we do now, pig?

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:27.750
It's all your fault that she won't
undo the spell.

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:29.090
It's my fault?

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:32.260
This whole thing has nothing to do
with us really.

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:35.840
Really. We now know the reason why
you look like this.

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:39.010
But why did I turn into a skunk?

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:42.350
But it isn't my fault.

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:46.400
This isn't fair that I became like this.
It's all society's fault.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:48.860
That's why I put a spell on
everybody.

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:50.230
Jerk!

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:54.490
You turned into this and it's all
your own fault.

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:57.950
Not only you don't feel sorry, but
you're also saying it's someone else's fault.

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:59.160
You are a yellow-dog.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.370
A yellow-dog.

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:03.080
He's crying now.

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:06.120
It's all because I feel lonely.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:09.670
Nobody wants to be my friend when
I look like this.

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:15.550
I thought if everybody else looked
like me, they would want to be my friends.

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:17.930
Oh, is that why?

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:20.890
Sana, think carefully,
what the old lady just said.

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:24.770
It's seems like he was harder to
get along with when he was human.

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:27.810
Oh, yeah, I won't believe you!

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.060
Be more aware.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:31.730
Don't be so mad, come over here to
the heated table and sit down.

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.240
Let's play King game.

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.900
Undo the spell first!

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:41.580
There's no solution. If the spell on me is not undone, I cannot undo yours.

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:44.580
Wasn't the old lady really mad
earlier?

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:50.630
Now our only option is waiting for the old
lady to cool off and undo the prince's spell.

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:54.090
Let's beg her together, I'm sure
she'll accept our apology.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:55.340
Yeah, let's do it.

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:56.590
No.

00:17:58.300 --> 00:17:59.510
Aw, it didn't work.

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:01.260
Gave up already?

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:03.020
Here is how to undo
the spell.

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:05.520
Where? Where? Let me see.

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:07.310
Don't push.

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:09.900
I stole it from
the wrinkly old lady.

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:13.230
Let's hope we can turn back into
humans before we get eaten.

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:16.070
Then I'll read it.

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:18.700
- Read fast.
- You have to read sentence by sentence.

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:21.330
Don't skip any kanji words that
you don't know.

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:23.660
To undo this spell,

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.000
a person must have three moles on
her behind,

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:28.870
be a 12 year old female, a first year junior high school student,

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:31.630
and give a kiss that comes from
the heart.

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:35.300
According to the description,
it's me?

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:38.010
This is so simple.

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:42.800
Skunk, kiss me, hurry.
All this will be solved.

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:44.010
Wait.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.850
What are you waiting for?

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:49.270
Of course I have to think first.
If he was human...

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:51.360
But he's a toilet seat.

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:52.980
It can't be like this.

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:55.690
Anybody wants to do it for me?
I'd sign an autograph for you.

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:57.240
Don't want one.

00:18:57.240 --> 00:19:01.110
Although we feel very sorry for
you... a girl with three moles

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:04.830
who is a 12 year old first year
junior high school student...

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.240
that's you.

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:09.920
I don't want to! I don't want to
kiss a toilet seat.

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:13.040
What did I do?
What did I do wrong?

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:15.130
Because you have moles.

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:17.920
Just a kiss,
you won't lose a piece of meat.

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.300
I will lose a piece of meat.

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:21.760
Forget it, Sana.

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:26.100
Just forget it, we can't just let
Sana suffer.

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:30.690
It's ok even if I have to look
like this for the rest of my life.

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:34.480
I'll join the gold fish department
next year.

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:36.820
I'm going with you.

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:40.200
Being like this the rest of our
lives.

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:42.360
Looking very upset.

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:46.120
Alright, I'll kiss you,
I will kiss you.

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:47.540
Wait, skunk-chan.

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:49.450
No, Sana-chan.

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:52.580
I knew you're Sana-chan early.

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:54.130
You know me?

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.130
Yeah, I've watched your
performances.

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:59.340
Thinking you're so cute and
energetic.

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:01.720
I've been admiring you.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:02.720
Really?

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:04.260
I'm really sorry.

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:09.560
When I realized Sana-chan had to
kiss me, I couldn't help but feel excited.

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:13.440
I promise you that if you're
willing to kiss me,

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:15.860
after turning back into a human,

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:20.320
I will make sure that I won't turn
into this again.

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:22.490
You won't throw trash everywhere
anymore?

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:23.530
Right.

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:26.660
You will take baths
and clean up your own mess?

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:29.700
My dear Sana-chan,
I wouldn't lie to you.

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:34.000
Amazing, according to the book,
the kiss has to come from the heart.

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:37.210
That toilet seat is intelligently
leading Sana's heart.

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:39.760
So prince Naozumi...

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:41.210
Sana-chan...

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:47.470
The first skunk and toilet seat
love scene.

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:49.100
Can't stand it.

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:53.270
Hello, is this star magazine?

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:55.270
I have first hand photos.

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:01.570
Prince Naozumi.

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:04.950
Sana-chan, thank you,
because of your kiss, I...

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:08.620
Huh? It's still a toilet seat.

