00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:26.840
Sana, this is not your first kiss?

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:28.220
That... umm...

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:29.970
That I know. It's your second.

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:31.390
