00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:37.730
I never heard you talk about it.

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:41.780
Why is this happening?
I had a kiss with the toilet seat.

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:44.240
Now what should we do?

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:46.950
Blaming me?
Annoying, I better escape.

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:48.280
Wait!

00:21:54.450 --> 00:21:57.670
The New Year's eve bell rang,
this year is over.

00:21:57.670 --> 00:22:01.040
Hey, the spell is broken,
