00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:12.810
Don't need to stress.

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:14.980
You all should've finished reading it.

00:22:14.980 --> 00:22:17.350
Oh well, just forget these people.

00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:20.610
